  "about": "The rules a translated string is held to beyond its placeholders (docs/translations.md): `rule` is the first one `text`, a translation of `english`, breaks, in the order control, invisible, combining_marks, bidi, formatting_code, line_break, length, unbroken_run, or null. tools/lang_coverage.py's text_problem and lang.rs's bundled-file test both read this file, so the importer and the test cannot drift.",
